<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-el-salvador"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20El%20Salvador.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of El Salvador</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">El Salvador adopts the US dollar</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/argentine-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Argentine%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Argentine Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Economic collapse ends in riots and a sovereign default</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/peoples-republic-of-china"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/People's%20Republic%20of%20China.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>People's Republic of China</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">China joins the World Trade Organization</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-somaliland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Somaliland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Somaliland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A referendum approves the constitution and independence</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/caral-supe-civilisation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Caral%E2%80%93Supe%20civilisation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Caral–Supe civilisation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A paper in Science by Ruth Shady, Jonathan Haas and Winifred Creamer brings Caral to wide attention</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hellenic-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hellenic%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hellenic Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The euro replaces the drachma in January.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/uzbekistan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Uzbekistan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Uzbekistan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After the 11 September attacks Uzbekistan grants the United States access to the Karshi-Khanabad airfield for operations in Afghanistan.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/kolkata"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kolkata.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kolkata</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The city's official name changes from Calcutta to Kolkata</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/lascaux"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lascaux.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Lascaux</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new air conditioning system is followed by an outbreak of the white mould Fusarium solani</span></li></ul></section>
